    <div class="policy-block">
      <h2>COOKIES POLICY</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-block">
      <h3>What sort of information do we collect?</h3>
      <p>When you visit our website, we use cookies to store your information such as the details you provide while placing your order that includes your name, address, contact number and email address. Cookies allows the website to remember your device and the ways you interacted with the website.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-block">
      <h3>What do we use your information for?</h3>
      <p>By saving the information you provide on website, through cookies, we use it in multiple ways:</p>
      <ol class="policy-list">
        <li>Cookie data is used by Google, as a third party, to put custom advertisements based on your preferences and your search history.</li>
        <li>We use cookie data to improve our website and provide users a seamless and more personalized experience.</li>
        <li>Cookie data helps us provide our customers a better service. The information we store helps us in catering to our users more efficiently and respond to their queries and needs in a more customer centric manner.</li>
        <li>We use cookies to process the transactions. Any information that you provide, whether public or private will never be exchanged or transferred, sold or given to any other company or agency without your total consent.</li>
        <li>By using the data that you provide on the website, we enable ourselves to send you periodic and personalized emails, get back to you for your queries and concerns or any other questions.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-block">
      <h3>How do we protect your information?</h3>
      <p>Cookie data is never shared with any other company or agency for any purpose. We protect every information ever stored that you provide while placing an order through a wide variety of steps.</p>
      <p>No user data is shared with any third party for any reason or purpose.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-block">
      <h3>Do we use the cookies?</h3>
      <p>We use the cookies that are small files, transferred by a service provider to the user's computer or handheld device through any web browser. It allows the website or the service provider to remember and recognize your browser, your preferences and information.</p>
      <p>Cookies help us to show users more of the things that we think they like.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-block">
      <h3>Do we disclose any information to outside parties?</h3>
      <p>We do not share, sell or trade any user information with any third party, agency. User data is totally protected through various steps and is never disclosed to even the third party agencies working closely with us on our website and business.</p>
      <p>We may release your information when we believe that releasing it will be appropriate in compliance with law, enforcement of our site policies, and protection of rights, safety or property. However, the non-personally identifiable information of a visitor might be provided to other parties for advertising, marketing or other appropriate purposes.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-block">
      <h3>Your Consent</h3>
      <p>By agreeing to allow us to use cookies, you come to agreement of everything mentioned above.</p>
      <p>We always use cookies with your total consent.</p>
    </div>

